          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्वभावः (svabhāvaḥ) is built from sva, \"own\", and bhāva, \"being\", from the root √bhū: one's own way of being; MW gives \"natural state, innate disposition, nature\" (MW)."
            }
          ]
        },
